    "stdout": "{   \"user-agent\": \"AngleSharp/1.11.0.0\" }\n{   \"user-agent\": \"\" }\n{   \"user-agent\": \"GardenBot/1.0 (+https://example.com/bot)\" }\nNo jar:    {   \"cookies\": {} }\nLanded on: http://localhost:8080/test-cases/get-cookies\nCookies:   {   \"cookies\": {     \"session\": \"abc123\"   } }\nNext run:  {   \"cookies\": {} }\nSubmit: 200 okay\nWrong:  400 error\nLanded on: http://localhost:8080/test-cases/status/404\nStatus:    404 NotFound\nOffline: 200 okay\nPosted:  Name=Test&Number=1&IsActive=true\nrobots.txt: User-agent: * Disallow: /deny",
